  "contentHtml": "<p>그때 누가 찾으신 것 같은데</p><p>네이버?에서 몇천원 주고 사서&#160;</p><p>편집해놨던게 기억나서 올립니다.</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvf0jvor2u89dtza1gnh1gdmv@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvf0jvor2u89dtza1gnh1gdmv/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33206522331&amp;signature=jYZ4f%2Fth9zcElregJx%2FLhnYIWX0%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvf0jvor2u89dtza1gnh1gdmv?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2ZjBqdm9yMnU4OWR0emExZ25oMWdkbXYiLCJ0aWQiOiJlZDVlOGQxNi0zNzBiLTQ0NmQtYTAyOC1lNjhkZTNkZmEyMTEiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODM3MDd9.TVkiAkVz5StPoxQEHMY6XczwbmlKNCQh1y8-80rorhg0FyxOC6dCRV1Vxcti0tdmWtYGE1Ko_ghSAgjj9cuBzA&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\">시작 부분</div></div><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rviowli45v8no7ygajjlh6k2e@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rviowli45v8no7ygajjlh6k2e/thumbs/6.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33206522448&amp;signature=ZOb9PH3Izl9Azryaqua%2F0j%2BYWVw%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rviowli45v8no7ygajjlh6k2e?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2aW93bGk0NXY4bm83eWdhampsaDZrMmUiLCJ0aWQiOiIwYTMxMzg2Zi0xMjRjLTRiMGEtODRlNS0yMzNhYjVkMmJhZTQiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODM3MDd9.xCSueS8DxUGNKvgXWau_4diRi5lHmZEGlZrCFd7-NXhrzH8DAP9Px8cl52cprSSrC9eGPNg8LfxlS5IggcFqNQ&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\">결과 부분입니다.</div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>중간 내용은 멤버들이 미션하면서 이기면 제작진이 힌트를 주고&#160;</p><p>미션 1~3등이 선택을 바꿀 수 있는 기회를 주더라구요&#160;</p><p>근데 아이들에게 풀영상을 보여줘도 별로 재밌어하지 않아서ㅜㅜㅜ</p><p>힌트만 캡쳐해뒀던 것 같아요..</p><p>&#160;</p><p>차라리 모둠별로 똑같은 프로그램을 진행하는게 더 재미있을 것 같아요</p><p>4년전 일이라서 가물가물..</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5e450a680b2d12c48177c9e510241823c2e3315b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5e450a680b2d12c48177c9e510241823c2e3315b\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"720\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/61b66c0d2430c0bd25aad3dfb08da0aef347bccb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/61b66c0d2430c0bd25aad3dfb08da0aef347bccb\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"720\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b8f323088cf7fb96aca2adb2c5f25ebf507a8aa9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b8f323088cf7fb96aca2adb2c5f25ebf507a8aa9\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"720\"></div><div class=\"figur